# Schist Cloud: the sign-in flow, the cloud gallery (sidebar rows, the
# grid's headings and empty states, the right-click menu, the dialogs),
# uploads and downloads, people and faces, image generation — and the
# status and error text crates/cloud hands the app to show verbatim.
# `cloud.services.*` is crates/app/src/workspace/services.rs: what the
# status bar says while a model, a font, an update or a plug-in is
# fetched from outside the app.
#
# "Schist Cloud" is a product name and stays as written in every
# language; the ☁ glyph that marks cloud rows is added in code.

# Status-bar and tray messages. `cloud.msg.not_signed_in` is the cloud
# panel's resting message; the gallery views compare against it to tell
# an idle tray from one showing an error.
